<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Foreigners net buyers of S.Africa shares last week.</title>
<headline>Foreigners net buyers of S.Africa shares last week.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Johannesburg Stock Exchange (JSE) said non-residents were net buyers of 133.47 million rand's worth of South African shares last week.</p>
<p>Non-resident transactions (million rand) -</p>
<p>			  Week to July 18     Year to date  Year ago</p>
<p>Equities:</p>
<p>- purchases		    1,461.97     37,863.86     24,184.56</p>
<p>- sales			  1,328,49     25,411.00     19,311.80</p>
<p>- net purchases/(sales)	133.47     12,452.86	4,872.75</p>
<p>NOTE - The figures reflect only the portion of the market</p>
<p>where non-resident transactions are executed through the JSE,</p>
<p>and are therefore not comprehensive.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482-1003</p>
</text>
